{"repositoryId":1353303911,"availability":"available","full":"Jen-Chieh-Yu/stray-atlas","name":"stray-atlas","description":"浪浪地圖 — 臺灣公立動物收容所開放資料分析與視覺化。以農業部每日更新的認養資料，呈現各縣市與收容所的在所動物與滯留天數。Vue 3 + Vite + GitHub Actions 每日快照存檔。","category":"Developer tools","language":"Vue","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-01T08:08:47Z","updated":"2026-10-16T02:55:51Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://jen-chieh-yu.github.io/stray-atlas/","topics":["animal-shelter","data-visualization","github-actions","github-pages","open-data","python","typescript","vite","vue"],"demo":"https://jen-chieh-yu.github.io/stray-atlas/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T23:50:16.654Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T23:50:16.654Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T23:50:16.654Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T23:50:16.654Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Vue","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["農業部「動物認領養」開放資料每日更新，內容是此刻仍開放認養的動物名冊。本專案每日自動保存快照並重建網站資料：清理欄位、為自由文字的尋獲地分級（刻意不轉成座標），並以互動地圖與分析頁呈現收容所的滯留狀況。","這份資料有幾個反直覺的陷阱，處理不當會得到看似漂亮但站不住腳的結論。如何避開這些陷阱，是本專案想展示的重點，勝過任何單一結論：資料限制、我踩過的統計陷阱，以及為什麼沒有尋獲地熱區圖，寫在 docs/METHODOLOGY.md；技術選擇與理由在 docs/ARCHITECTURE.md。"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Jen-Chieh-Yu/stray-atlas/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"558668a66bb051fdc55fccf0d957fdd3e01c5648dd6f2268cad76154d26106f3","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T23:50:16.762Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T23:50:16.762Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"農業部「動物認領養」開放資料每日更新，內容是此刻仍開放認養的動物名冊。本專案每日自動保存快照並重建網站資料：清理欄位、為自由文字的尋獲地分級（刻意不轉成座標），並以互動地圖與分析頁呈現收容所的滯留狀況。","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Jen-Chieh-Yu/stray-atlas/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"558668a66bb051fdc55fccf0d957fdd3e01c5648dd6f2268cad76154d26106f3","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Jen-Chieh-Yu/stray-atlas/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T23:50:16.763Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-16T02:55:51Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","